[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082707129","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108562#issuecomment-3082707129","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108562","id":3082707129,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63vmC5","user":{"login":"notroid5","id":87585310,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3NTg1MzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87585310?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5","html_url":"https://github.com/notroid5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/notroid5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T06:10:16Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T06:10:16Z","body":"I can reproduce the issue with Neo 2:\n- works in 4.4 Beta 2\n- does not work in 4.4.1\n\nPossibly related PRs from 4.4 Beta 3 Changelog:\n#101754 => works\n#102169 => not working\n#102448 => not working\n\nNot familiar with Neo 2 though, so maybe I did something wrong.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082707129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4347270082","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108562#issuecomment-4347270082","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108562","id":4347270082,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAx4Twg","user":{"login":"SasaSuppenknecht","id":51749494,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNzQ5NDk0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51749494?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht","html_url":"https://github.com/SasaSuppenknecht","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SasaSuppenknecht/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T20:25:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T20:25:04Z","body":"I am having the same issue with Bone layout (related to Neo) using Godot 4.6.2. \nJust today I switched from Windows to Linux (ubuntu) and suddenly had this problem, but worked fine under Windows","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4347270082/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5279937987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108562#issuecomment-5279937987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108562","id":5279937987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOrV1ww","user":{"login":"d-kurz","id":148091278,"node_id":"U_kgDOCNOxjg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148091278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz","html_url":"https://github.com/d-kurz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-kurz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-13T11:42:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T11:42:40Z","body":"I had the same problem, but could resolve it by specifying the display driver.\n\nUnder KDE Plasma (Wayland):\n`godot` → broken\n`godot --display-driver wayland` → works\n\nThis also slightly changed Godot's appearance for me.\n\nValid display drivers are listed under `godot --help`.\n\nIf this also works for you with one of the drivers, and you launch Godot via its entry in the desktop menu, you can make it permanent like so:\n1. Create a file with the content below at `${HOME}/.local/share/applications/org.godotengine.Godot.desktop`\n2. Run `xdg-desktop-menu install \"${HOME}/.local/share/applications/org.godotengine.Godot.desktop`\n\nContent, but ⚠️ remember to replace `--display-driver wayland` with your correct driver:\n```ini\n[Desktop Entry]\nCategories=Development;IDE;\nComment=Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine with a feature-rich editor\nExec=godot --display-driver wayland %f\nGenericName=Libre game engine\nIcon=godot\nKeywords=game development;development;IDE;game engine;\nMimeType=application/x-godot-project;\nName=Godot Engine\nNoDisplay=false\nPrefersNonDefaultGPU=false\nStartupNotify=true\nStartupWMClass=Godot\nTerminal=false\nType=Application\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5279937987/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]